    "hob": {
      "word": "HOB",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "The hub of a wheel. See Hub. Washington.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "The flat projection or iron shelf at the side of a fire grate, where things are put to be kept warm. Smart.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "(Mech.)",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A threaded and fluted hardened steel cutter, resembling a tap, used in a lathe for forming the teeth of screw chasers, worm wheels, etc.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A fairy; a sprite; an elf. [Obs.] From elves, hobs, and fairies, . . . Defend us, good Heaven ! Beau. &",
